markdown <<MARKDOWN
## Stepping Through a For Loop

You just saw the for loop's syntax and output side by side. Now watch it execute one step at a time, the exact same trace your students will follow in Lesson 7. Click Next to step forward, Back to reverse, and notice what happens right at the end, when the loop checks range(5) one more time and finds nothing left.

